Development Milestones
Final Version — Multi-Instrument Sessions
Up to 10 Pairs  ·  Shared Margin Pool  ·  Synchronized Execution

Session Setup  →  Execution  →  Excursion Engine  →  Post-Exit  →  Storage  →  Dashboard  →  What-If

What’s New in This Version
The session now supports up to 10 instruments simultaneously. The user configures spread and commission per pair. All pairs share one account balance and one margin pool.

The critical new challenge: when the user advances bars on one chart, ALL other instruments with open or post-exit trades must advance in lockstep by time. This document specifies exactly how to handle that synchronization.

What’s Already Done
Charting tool, drawing tools, and order window are complete. These milestones cover everything from session creation forward.

