Phased Approach Recommendation
This is a complex system. Recommend building in two phases:

PHASE 1 (ship first): Single active instrument at a time. The user can have multiple instruments in the session, but can only place and manage trades on the currently displayed chart. When switching instruments, all trades on the previous chart must be closed or in post-exit. This eliminates the background processing challenge entirely while still delivering multi-instrument analytics.

PHASE 2 (upgrade): Full time synchronization. Background trades process alongside the active chart. Notifications for background trade events. Open positions panel.

Phase 1 delivers 90% of the value with 60% of the engineering effort. Phase 2 is a polish upgrade that makes the experience seamless.

